| 1 | §10 | Clarify that chapters already have full content; only `full_text` field needs the fix |
| 2 | §18 | Add note about [create_page_chapters](file:///c:/kahoot/backend/app/utils/pdf_parser.py#223-248) 5000-char truncation |
| 3 | §11.1 | Consider renaming `upload_pdf` → [upload_document](file:///c:/kahoot/backend/app/routers/documents.py#11-71) |
| 4 | §11.2 | Specify `num_questions` range as 1–50 |
| 5 | §11.2 | Add content minimum length validation (100 chars) |
| 6 | §13 | Clarify or remove `models.py` from V1 |
| 7 | §11.1 | Use UUID for `document_id` instead of sequential |
| 8 | §13 | Add `.env.example` to folder layout |

**None of these are blockers.** The plan is ready to implement — these are quality improvements to make before or during execution.
